4.2 Interactions

We have started a dialog with the WELD project (Web-Based Electronic
Design), headed by Prof. Richard Newton
(http://www-cad.eecs.berkeley.edu/Respep/Research/weld).  WELD uses
the notion of "proxies" to provide a Java-based interface between
design tools that are distributed on the network.  We are particularly
interested in augmenting the capability to also support Itcl-based
interactions, so that more sophisticated user interfaces can be
developed more easily (at least today).

